      "content": "I can provide general information on iron supplementation, but please note that high-dose protocols should be approached with caution and under medical supervision. Some biohackers suggest a \"loading phase\" of 600-1200 mcg (micrograms) of iron per day for 5-7 days to rapidly saturate the body's iron stores. However, elemental iron is typically available in 65-130 mg (milligrams) or 18-26 mg per capsule, not micrograms. Dividing the daily dose into multiple smaller doses throughout the day may help minimize gastrointestinal side effects.",
